      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- ============================================\n     NUR PROTOCOL — ABOUT / FOUNDER PAGE\n     Facts confirmed by the user, nothing invented:\n     - Founder goes by first name only (\"Myriam\") — she also works\n       as a yacht broker and wants to stay hard to cross-reference\n       by full name, so no surname anywhere on this page.\n     - cAIre Solutions (2023-2025): built AI agents for luxury\n       brands, esthetic clinics and skincare brands.\n     - Beauty World Dubai 2025, Dubai World Trade Center: speaker\n       at \"Next in Beauty\" on AI closing the gap between overwhelmed\n       consumers and the products their skin actually needs.\n     - Beauty AI Innovation Award, Woman of Heart Awards (WOHA),\n       presented by H.E. Dr. Desziree Richardson.\n     PHOTO SLOTS: replace each .nur-about__placeholder with a real\n     <img src=\"{{ 'FILENAME.webp' | asset_url }}\" ...> once the user\n     sends her Beauty World Dubai / award photos. Never fill with\n     stock images.\n     ============================================ -->\n\n<style>\n  .nur-about {\n    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .nur-about__hero {\n    background-color: #FAFAF8;\n    padding: 100px 40px 88px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__hero-inner {\n    max-width: 780px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__title {\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.2vw, 50px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.6px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #5A5A5A;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    max-width: 640px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead + .nur-about__lead {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__lead strong {\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Recognition ---------- */\n  .nur-about__recognition {\n    background-color: #0E0D0B;\n    padding: 88px 40px 96px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognition-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto 56px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognition-eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__recognition-title {\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 28px;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card {\n    background-color: #17150F;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,169,110,0.18);\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card-media {\n    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.25);\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card-media img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card-body {\n    padding: 28px 28px 32px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card-tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.1px;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__card-text {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */\n  .nur-about__cta {\n    background-color: #FAFAF8;\n    padding: 88px 40px 100px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-title {\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    margin-right: auto;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-title em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #C8A96E;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-link {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    background: #1A1A1A;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border: 1.5px solid #1A1A1A;\n    padding: 13px 28px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, gap 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .nur-about__cta-link:hover {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    gap: 11px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 980px) {\n    .nur-about__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 460px; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .nur-about__hero { padding: 64px 20px 56px; }\n    .nur-about__recognition { padding: 64px 20px 64px; }\n    .nur-about__recognition-header { margin-bottom: 40px; }\n    .nur-about__cta { padding: 64px 20px 72px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"nur-about\">\n\n  <section class=\"nur-about__hero\">\n    <div class=\"nur-about__hero-inner\">\n      <span class=\"nur-about__eyebrow\">The Founder</span>\n      <h1 class=\"nur-about__title\">I didn't start in beauty<br><em>I started in AI</em></h1>\n      <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">Before Nur Protocol, I spent two years building AI agents for luxury brands, esthetic clinics and skincare companies through <strong>cAIre Solutions</strong> (2023&ndash;2025).</p>\n      <p class=\"nur-about__lead\">Nur Skincoach isn't a feature bolted onto a mask after the fact. It's what happens when that same AI expertise finally points at your own skin, instead of someone else's business.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"nur-about__recognition\">\n    <div class=\"nur-about__recognition-header\">\n      <span class=\"nur-about__recognition-eyebrow\">Recognized In The Industry</span>\n      <h2 class=\"nur-about__recognition-title\">Said on stage,<br><em>not just on a landing page</em></h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"nur-about__grid\">\n      <div class=\"nur-about__card\">\n        <div class=\"nur-about__card-media\">\n          <img src=\"{{ 'myriam-next-in-beauty-stage.webp' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Myriam speaking on the Next in Beauty panel at Beauty World Dubai 2025\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nur-about__card-body\">\n          <span class=\"nur-about__card-tag\">Beauty World Dubai 2025</span>\n          <h3 class=\"nur-about__card-title\">Speaker, Next in Beauty</h3>\n          <p class=\"nur-about__card-text\">Invited to speak at Next in Beauty, held at the Dubai World Trade Center, on how AI closes the gap between consumers overwhelmed by information online and the products their skin actually needs, helping shoppers feel understood and helping brands convert that clarity into sales.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"nur-about__card\">\n        <div class=\"nur-about__card-media\">\n          <img src=\"{{ 'myriam-next-in-beauty-slide.webp' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Official Next in Beauty speaker lineup for the AI-Powered Beauty panel, Beauty World Dubai 2025\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nur-about__card-body\">\n          <span class=\"nur-about__card-tag\">AI-Powered Beauty Panel</span>\n          <h3 class=\"nur-about__card-title\">Official speaker lineup</h3>\n          <p class=\"nur-about__card-text\">Listed alongside founders from Lóvi, Vason Global Strategies and LluMina on the AI-Powered Beauty: The Future of Skincare, Haircare &amp; Makeup panel.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"nur-about__card\">\n        <div class=\"nur-about__card-media\">\n          <img src=\"{{ 'myriam-woha-award.webp' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Myriam holding the Beauty AI Innovation Award at the Women of Heart Awards, Dubai\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nur-about__card-body\">\n          <span class=\"nur-about__card-tag\">Woman Of Heart Awards</span>\n          <h3 class=\"nur-about__card-title\">Beauty AI Innovation Award</h3>\n          <p class=\"nur-about__card-text\">Presented by H.E. Dr. Desziree Richardson, recognizing the work behind the AI approach that now powers Nur Skincoach.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"nur-about__cta\">\n    <h2 class=\"nur-about__cta-title\">The same AI thinking<br><em>now built into your mask</em></h2>\n    <a href=\"/products/nur-protocol\" class=\"nur-about__cta-link\">Shop Nur Protocol <span>&rarr;</span></a>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n",
